{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_title", "source_sha256": "fe90f67997a77594fb8ddb4b8fd79d2e8ac1f4e98a16710c420e68b03d89deec", "ja": "一緒に、笑って", "zh": "一同欢笑", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c432a44f8cb48571b885f1b8f5e7dc9b7be98da8c27bc1207703273587a230ca", "ja": "海美の新曲が教育番組の体操コーナーで\n使われる事に。参加を渋る男の子から理由を\n聞いた海美は悩むが、「運動が嫌な思い出の\nまま終わっててほしくない」という自分の\n気持ちに気づき、解決方法を考える。", "zh": "海美的新曲被教育节目的体操环节\n选用了。海美向不愿参加的小男孩\n询问了原因后十分烦恼，但她察觉到了\n自己“不希望运动只留下讨厌的回忆”\n的心情，并开始思考解决办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1000_null", "source_sha256": "c40d8a309b871fd82a5ef990c72ee8b535a722ea7e3a50e883be8eef1103343d", "ja": "教育番組　収録前……", "zh": "少儿节目　录制前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "1ce9b33d640bd8ea14f25c7d66ce93734009f83aef9e27bfa8d097864afb6e7f", "ja": "ほらほら、行くよーーーっ！　みんな、私に\n捕まらないように逃げて！　……って、あれ？", "zh": "快快，要开始啦——！大家快逃，别被我抓到！……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "ec0382811aea01b0af2d775932ffca8cb698c02ac65b8adb7d51bd048944e481", "ja": "……ん？　んんんん？", "zh": "……嗯？　嗯嗯嗯嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1003_p", "source_sha256": "10b045b959898a0e947b37a91bfa9640bdf108a539856826960193bf6c9e81e0", "ja": "（子ども番組の収録中。ひとりだけ運動に参加して\nいない男の子がいる事に、海美も気が付いたようだ）", "zh": "（正在录制儿童节目。海美似乎也注意到了，有个男孩子没有参加运动。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "17147953ac059dc17ca68b87ac8388efd94c2a16a910c4dfd89f9b02db3711a2", "ja": "ねね、キミ。どうかしたの？\n鬼ゴッコ、好きじゃなかった？", "zh": "喂，你怎么了？不喜欢玩捉鬼游戏吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "dc6610750bd4a28faa3b8215b5801cf02ea827d7c25c5d368852c0c90f91f0c2", "ja": "でも、大丈夫だよ！　今のはウォーミングアップで、\nこの後は『美ルドアップ体操』だから！", "zh": "不过，没关系！刚才只是热身，接下来可是《美力提升体操》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "cf86a6d9fd4661eeee0516de7ff1b21d7cb4ddfb9bb91a38ba60b3bd962f6a3f", "ja": "ダンスみたいに、音楽に合わせて体操するの！\nきっと楽しいよーっ☆", "zh": "像跳舞一样，跟着音乐做体操！\n一定会很开心的哦——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1007_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "4881ee02b27bf74449b72685d08ef2a21a495b01acde105749c74833deacb52c", "ja": "……ダンスも、たいそうも、べつに、すきじゃないし。\nふとくいなんです。", "zh": "……跳舞也好，体操也好，我其实并不喜欢。\n而且也不擅长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "aa4eac2225f2996e53b05da80142a24ab93194fd5e09173906397811764b7210", "ja": "えっ……。\n体動かすの、嫌いなの？", "zh": "诶……  \n你不喜欢运动身体吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1009_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "7bdcb5a04b4436e6b6fb39edaed66c2ec2e329ffe9bf78da49d6562b9b497def", "ja": "……きらいじゃないけど、じょうずにできないから。\nできないと、笑われるし。", "zh": "……倒不是讨厌，只是因为做不好。\n要是做不好，还会被别人笑话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "ff584e08fd822c1173177303ed8e811f19822e6109dfb8b61a254c40dcb2bb43", "ja": "なーんだ！　そういうことなら、\n私が教えてあげるから……。", "zh": "原来是这样！既然如此，就由我来教你吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1011_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "130dbee93e5d00ad84ad5924fdc6ad03a8e67f057e3183ee448aa72ce82768a1", "ja": "へいきです、そういうの。ほかのコーナーで、\n見せ場はつくるようにしてますし。", "zh": "没关系，这种事我不在意。其他环节我也会努力创造表现机会的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1012_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "3a51e04ba9ffe4f9c50becf2edfafe60dc403a6ec009c8564388d604ab0773cc", "ja": "この番組は、子役のとうりゅうもんだから\nしゅつえんしているだけなので。", "zh": "只是因为这个节目是童星的登龙门，所以才来出演的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1013_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "abf92cf198b538979138cc0edf34d16aa7bd75f2d5253c8f15044bcebc6e8da9", "ja": "せるふぶらんでぃんぐは、ちゃんとできてます。", "zh": "个人品牌塑造做得很到位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "534293f0c191cbc1a1d08f5ef45776478ed03a016be86ef0aea140fe5be0abe7", "ja": "ええ～……。そんなこと言わないで、\n私と一緒に、『美ルドアップ体操』踊ろ？", "zh": "诶～……别这么说嘛，\n和我一起跳《美肌锻炼操》吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "6001f3a66b07808abee6ea1af9d395cceb573610f1c6b18922419c6d8069c2b3", "ja": "それに、体操して筋肉がついたら、\nいろんなことができるようになるよ！", "zh": "而且，做体操练出肌肉后，就能做到各种各样的事情了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1016_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "465765d0f2eb22ebe2e90a2d4ad8fac51fcfaa3b964509c0e1db51c7564eeb02", "ja": "……いろんなこと？", "zh": "……各种各样的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "199b6f1ff49d2e964bf097c2f1685f0134543c4d6645326bd419965c54eb8143", "ja": "そう！　筋肉があれば、今できないことだって、\n何だってできるようになっちゃうんだから！", "zh": "没错！只要有肌肉，就连现在做不到的事情，也全都能做到啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1018_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "cfc0ae57325a874d697cc79a0e245477de1e036bbf3a7f06dff1ad513d35a9b9", "ja": "……。でも、おねえさんはいま、\nぼくをおどらせることができませんけど。", "zh": "……不过，大姐姐现在没办法让我跳舞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "b2121b8e430e791a510d2418bfa6919dbc8412ae73f02e0f4620780868ef4f88", "ja": "……。\nああっ！？　本当だ！？", "zh": "……。\n啊！？真的诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "e1438cc2e2c59369628e1d2d472526a3c955d1f8767c184d9237bc1abae2c7a0", "ja": "うみみん、小学生にリンパ腺されるとはね……。\nここは真美の出番かな！", "zh": "没想到海美竟然被小学生“淋巴腺”了……这里就该真美出场啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "93ccadbfce40ba5d9525fdd5c777a769f88b354eccf6d538fde57ce02657bcb4", "ja": "リンパ腺……？\nあ、もしかして論破のこと？", "zh": "淋巴腺……？\n啊，难道你说的是“论破”？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1022_012mam", "source_sha256": "c073977ca8367a6e27e82c58fa25e1ee3cd3ff22a89394c978ed0dc3115153ab", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　うみみんで物足りないなら、\n真美とせくちー鬼ゴッコ、しちゃう？", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪ 要是海美还让你觉得不过瘾的话，\n要不要和真美玩性感鬼抓人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1023_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "4bc978740335fc44c8b7e650036b58f9e5f3d27a7200893ec2fa5d8a915e43f1", "ja": "いえ。どういうものでも、けっこうです。", "zh": "不，怎样都可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1024_012mam", "source_sha256": "373e8690c7f95167d03fd2a673f132a0c70f3b746de4541f4d0dc9b072866fc0", "ja": "ま、真美のお色気攻撃に眉ひとつ動かさないだと！？\nもしや幼すぎて、大人のミリキが伝わらないのか……！", "zh": "面、面对真美的性感攻势，居然连眉头都没皱一下！？\n难道是因为太小了，体会不到成熟的魅腻吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "800daca248c9f98fa419be4edb88bf3ec956c7809f4f1fe340d8a379baa2b226", "ja": "もう……！　ちょっと、キミ！\n子役ならもうすこし、現場のことを考えないと。", "zh": "真是的……！喂，你！既然是童星，就得再多为现场考虑一下才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1026_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "31e37d8ac146ec49cb2040295d2e396ad81734c7b6c77b5917c13ef734bfe3d1", "ja": "いきなり大きな声を出すなんて、しつれいな人ですね。\nそっちのほうが、くうきをみだしてますよ。", "zh": "突然大喊大叫的，真是个没礼貌的人呢。\n你那样才更破坏气氛吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1027_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "a8d967650b7dd265b8de6e3f4959faf2fe42c4b5bedc14efe73c0adb97df48da", "ja": "ぼくがたいそうのコーナーに出なくたって、\nしゅうろくはかのうなはずです。", "zh": "就算我不参加体操环节，也应该可以录制才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "c688a67fe38e1b707c70d3f2f3ab90c7c1def7fcfe207a24b959138aa08715e3", "ja": "ぐぬぬ……！", "zh": "唔唔唔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1029_017kth", "source_sha256": "9d80bd50321807f97503add822c7da501484935619652bf7698e9c7721dc1533", "ja": "なかなか気難しい子みたいですね。\nそういう年頃なのかな……。", "zh": "看来是个相当难相处的孩子呢。\n这个年纪就是这样吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1030_017kth", "source_sha256": "2ce18c950c92b352d564dff905682891600f2b2d70c1e5d340c7ff026d7aac92", "ja": "ただ、ちょっと心配なのが……。", "zh": "不过，让人有点担心的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1031_kodomo1", "source_sha256": "592eeffde0441f504b99b644298d8e49faef06e16b03e1344ea0e18247689fad", "ja": "ねえねえ、たいそう、まだ～？", "zh": "喂喂，体操还没开始吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1032_kodomo2", "source_sha256": "974eaedcd5e5d24ff6e5ed9b8fa1b1f9725750defc8fa53417e3d8b88668f5cb", "ja": "お話しばっかり、つまんないよ～！", "zh": "光说话，太没意思啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1033_017kth", "source_sha256": "81eeabd9b6bc55e25b53b8aaa98488bb42d3f7a4684be2c9d8948d417ab72472", "ja": "あっ……やっぱり。子どもたちのテンションが、\n落ちてきてます。急がないと……。", "zh": "啊……果然。孩子们的情绪，\n开始低落了。得赶紧才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1034_p", "source_sha256": "64f8927df8ac5d0666e5bafa32c0bbd0dadac7500e1150dd8d963c287e554e6e", "ja": "そうだな……。", "zh": "是啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1035_bangumid", "source_sha256": "3fb718401bfe42077e92d4a97ab5ed9165e77b39bce228ed179644c4ce22e378", "ja": "765プロさん、お世話になってます。\nあの、ちょっとよろしいですか？", "zh": "765事务所，承蒙关照了。\n那个，能耽误您一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1036_p", "source_sha256": "2ec88fb18e3f508b09305a3f018f516fb89a205cfad75029f77886f84700d685", "ja": "あ、番組ディレクターの……\nこちらこそ、お世話になってます。", "zh": "啊，节目导演……彼此彼此，也承蒙您关照了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1037_bangumid", "source_sha256": "4ea209345ce3b5d5e53393754741649a47d2dac68ee09f7d49fed14e2807c536", "ja": "あの男の子なんですけど。本人の言う通り、\n他のコーナーで活躍させてあげられると思うんです。", "zh": "说的是那个男孩子。他本人也这么说，我觉得可以让他在其他环节大显身手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1038_bangumid", "source_sha256": "7c1add2cee95024cfd97a0100960c33d9e5b8c7291feef73328b539f4b57f3c5", "ja": "なので今日の撮影では、体操のコーナーから\n出演を外しても、特に問題ないかと……。", "zh": "所以今天的拍摄，就算把体操环节从出演安排中去掉，应该也没什么问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1039_029umi", "source_sha256": "1e962e9fd8d5ab08063dddd18c722d33db83a80efc105c6d0255b63530480933", "ja": "え、ええ～っ！？　{$P$}！\nあの子のこと、外しちゃうの！！？", "zh": "诶、诶诶——！？{$P$}！\n要把那孩子排除在外吗！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1040_p", "source_sha256": "7f9a780cd82595f764ebf166b1d432f487c610bd1aa18435ac78b4dccb9347e0", "ja": "海美、少し待っていてくれるか？\nまだディレクターさんと話してる最中だから。", "zh": "海美，你能稍微等我一下吗？\n我还在和导演先生谈事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1041_029umi", "source_sha256": "ba9748c1469c754476047a791c9bfd780e6422ce7d802ae02ede5d1205f5baab", "ja": "あっ、そ、そうだったんだ！？\n私ってば、ごめんなさい……！", "zh": "啊，原来是、是这样啊！？\n真是的，对不起……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1042_bangumid", "source_sha256": "8f6e7db7b78125c809b8ad0c75935f41c51d646c7eca8dc2f0606d68ef9eea84", "ja": "いえ。\nこちらこそ、難しい子ですみません。", "zh": "不，是我才该道歉。  \n对不起，我是个不好相处的孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1043_p", "source_sha256": "11717aaa5ca0ee767932015cd59975c0c9b6c56e6b8e58fdf72f105a7f54ac58", "ja": "……ありがとうございます。ただ、あの子を\n外すかどうかの判断は、もう少し待ってもらえますか？", "zh": "……非常感谢。不过，关于是否要把那孩子\n换下来的决定，能请您再稍微等等吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1044_p", "source_sha256": "6e16b4422bf4048ebe376aaaaf744336b80915fd55e7ef052c81dd4815a2514b", "ja": "撮影日は、他にも設けてありますし……\n今日のところは。", "zh": "拍摄日还另外安排了几天……今天就先到这里吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1045_bangumid", "source_sha256": "031b8503a0d41687d44a8cb3fcee439d4d7555d8863e88620ee7ea75dac77b14", "ja": "そうですね……わかりました。\nでは、今日は可能なところだけ進行ということで。", "zh": "这样啊……我明白了。那么，今天就先推进能推进的部分吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1046_029umi", "source_sha256": "758da9a621a4e1a900083e9896b018481cef345f29ac797680d99527012e8d87", "ja": "ほっ……。", "zh": "呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1047_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1048_029umi", "source_sha256": "e30417c44af8ec2bb767af379f1812874371d685445f467c77526332c7a6e4f8", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとね。\nあの男の子のこと、外さないでくれて。", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你。\n谢谢你没有把那个男孩子排除在外。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1049_p", "source_sha256": "29fb7e02dad09c4bb7bd45c363428f920f38b183e3433bf59d056d3d4be06e89", "ja": "いや。もし外れてもらう事になるとしても、\n海美の話を聞いてからにしないとだしな。", "zh": "不用谢。就算真的要让他退出，\n也得先听听海美你的想法才行嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1050_p", "source_sha256": "acb87771274523988bc34f872fa147bfaf087fed68cb883bf775975491b61b17", "ja": "それに……俺も、運動が苦手だからといって、\nそのまま外すというのは違うと思ったから。", "zh": "而且……我也觉得，不能因为她不擅长运动，就直接让她退出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1051_029umi", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1052_p", "source_sha256": "546f29ea9e0b3596d5635453fc4ff9906bf43e07f2c92e03f8a130888105aa19", "ja": "海美も、何か言いたい事があるんだろう？\nあの男の子にこだわる理由とか……。", "zh": "海美也有想说的话吧？\n比如为什么会那么在意那个男孩子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1053_029umi", "source_sha256": "d7fc5c5a3ecbb7d71a63ad437d552a26bb3cc42769b6c92ce31cfdca15070cc1", "ja": "うーん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1054_p", "source_sha256": "d1ec457a253070b4e396d6b27fd727294efcf84943a49437cf7c711ea688b4a3", "ja": "『美ルドアップ体操』だし、\n筋肉ムキムキになってほしいとか？", "zh": "既然是《美肌锻炼操》，是希望我变得肌肉发达之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1055_029umi", "source_sha256": "44deca7971098f53df5d0471a4753f79dde11c15806a7a04d31830c81495f551", "ja": "ううん！\nそういうことじゃないなぁ……。", "zh": "不对啦！\n并不是那么回事呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1056_p", "source_sha256": "112e70041310768aaca7dd0016f330cc366cadedcf879bb43143f5fc7d5e35ea", "ja": "なら、運動の楽しさを知ってほしいとか？", "zh": "难道是想让她了解运动的乐趣？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1057_029umi", "source_sha256": "847e8c680aa82b8ad4312dd39fb5d6a9ad3cd4cd24a01dd5d0d148859b3ca1c5", "ja": "それは、もちろん！　でも……好きじゃないのに、\n無理矢理やらせるのは、よくないって思ってるよ？", "zh": "那当然！不过……明明不喜欢，却硬要逼人去做，我觉得这样不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1058_029umi", "source_sha256": "8c921a5e7656fe8d08674303f0ac73d795a94beb6254a2fbf2be2e6b0beb2738", "ja": "そんなことしたら、逆に嫌いになっちゃうし！\nえっと、そうじゃなくて、うーん……。", "zh": "要是那样做，反而会变得讨厌的！\n呃，不是这个意思，嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1059_029umi", "source_sha256": "e90d30f4fb7c6399418a51cd30a0ed23d636144083ed280189b37f3a0e11f721", "ja": "ごめん、{$P$}。\n私、なんか上手く話せないかも……。", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}。\n我好像……不太会表达……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1060_p", "source_sha256": "cd370a42033e2e8d5a44f8b14ea168c8a8bb8137776bf4058ef8689167cf8c96", "ja": "大丈夫。\nすぐ答えが出るものでもないと思うし。", "zh": "没事的。\n我想这种事本来就不是马上能得出答案的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1061_029umi", "source_sha256": "7f5e220668bd6c729bcb406413913ae52d0a086d070ae3a427534d3e24ac007e", "ja": "うん……。でも、次の収録までに\nちゃんと考えておく！", "zh": "嗯……不过，我会在下次录制之前\n好好想清楚的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1062_p", "source_sha256": "67645e84d05b1041c45f8089e78a66f709142becc4a92b4e90df4ba072060a49", "ja": "ああ、わかった。", "zh": "啊，我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1063_p", "source_sha256": "0ab9cb09a59443128783cc1212b158ba8b4345dd0f947c2ab30f1ae6579262f3", "ja": "（海美、言語化が得意という訳でもないからな。\n焦ることでもないし、もう少し見守ろうか）", "zh": "（海美毕竟也不太擅长把想法说清楚。\n也没什么好着急的，再观察一会儿吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1064_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1065_029umi", "source_sha256": "a23ae7cf13e56fe96fcf6c6e290f87b27b572f68142384bb9dd706b0aebcd36d", "ja": "う～～～ん……。", "zh": "嗯～～～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1066_015siz", "source_sha256": "133c5aae04c3ab0c81f91b060e5e7635b32a9467af88c3717694b0b11e11ffcd", "ja": "海美さん、あれからずっと悩んでる。\n無理もないのかな……。", "zh": "海美一直在为那件事烦恼。\n也难怪…… velog", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1067_017kth", "source_sha256": "f42714e484470d0867c66720e8da5d7eeb1e0fa1d650fbbb89444850665beb2e", "ja": "スポーツが苦手な子の気持ちだもんね。\n正反対の海美ちゃんには、理解しづらいのかも……。", "zh": "毕竟是对不擅长运动的孩子来说的心情嘛。\n对于性格截然相反的海美，可能不太容易理解……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1068_012mam", "source_sha256": "f3caec5ea15d799c8627dd54b2b83de0dc1fb92680bbc13c6bfe99dde73e2db6", "ja": "うみみんをここまで悩ませるとは……\nあの少年、なかなかやりますなあ。", "zh": "竟然能把海美美烦恼成这样……\n那个少年，还真有两下子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1069_049mom", "source_sha256": "d46b65a690c3735bc4e84e7a3bd9ad8465aa334c43d3675403528e7e4bdbcc55", "ja": "感心してる場合じゃないよ、真美さん！\nなんとかしないと……。", "zh": "现在不是感慨的时候啦，真美姐！不想想办法的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1070_049mom", "source_sha256": "b491aa7d3f934185b8a6077b63fa2204ef1e6eb7135ea0a2f39c00cb54bf7dd6", "ja": "お兄ちゃん、海美さんこんなに困ってるんだよ。\n何かいいアイディアないの？", "zh": "哥哥，海美小姐都这么困扰了。\n你就没有什么好主意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1071_p", "source_sha256": "eea90c8a296c2fa8b19270a170325d46d361d4e84210f91c23438159f0a3d38d", "ja": "そうだな……でも……。", "zh": "是啊……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1072_029umi", "source_sha256": "6280f992a87c675e33b40b7e4139bec2bbe58548f264f223168f94c3c7c5e048", "ja": "う～～～ん……。\nううううう～～～ん……。", "zh": "嗯～～～……。\n唔唔唔唔唔～～～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1073_p", "source_sha256": "4b6132cf788928bae9b6d40e1ca00ea0dbd129eb7df352eba1d8245cbeeb877b", "ja": "（悩みながらも、海美は必死に考えている。\n……なら、本人が諦めるまで任せてみよう）", "zh": "（海美虽然很烦恼，却还是拼命思考着。……既然这样，就先让她自己坚持到放弃为止吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1074_null", "source_sha256": "b95cacc0578f28b82e9a06650cc0269550d2ff275915d9e1fafebe2dd45098c9", "ja": "そして、前回の収録から1週間後。\n教育番組の収録スタジオ……", "zh": "然后，在上次录制的1周后。\n教育节目的录制现场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1075_029umi", "source_sha256": "6a20850a6210931b476934ac38c51ec65ec22d29afb32bf6fa1ed8e27a19fc18", "ja": "ごめんね、{$P$}。\n私、やっぱりはっきりした答えが出ないみたい……。", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}。\n我果然还是没法给出明确的答案……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1076_p", "source_sha256": "ba1efa84644c80502cb5df293940d0034e2feeedcdb940e0ebf2639a1eec178f", "ja": "わかった。その事は気にしなくていい。\n今は収録に集中して、海美らしい笑顔で頑張ろう！", "zh": "我明白了。那件事不用放在心上。\n现在集中精力录制，用海美式的笑容加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1077_staff", "source_sha256": "297850b19d42ae3c0495e732d6b9838ac5248c376e63f57012865ef6e08023cb", "ja": "高坂さん、すみませーん！　立ち位置を少し\n確認したいんですけど、よろしいでしょうか！", "zh": "高坂小姐，不好意思——！我想确认一下站位，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1078_029umi", "source_sha256": "8a56f3160c653025e2d5e081dce69d24c814717863d69318cff9be2e0d29a752", "ja": "あっ、はーい！　{$P$}、\n私ちょっと行ってくるね！", "zh": "啊，好——！{$P$}，我先过去一下哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1079_p", "source_sha256": "36715a0db82dfed3cebfb77240a999689b9a75e47453710dab9c549718e0684c", "ja": "ああ！", "zh": "嗯嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1080_bangumid", "source_sha256": "446285736599b711c26b937c20161c3217f5b7aee60f99e84d7ddd169cd2580c", "ja": "あっ、765プロさん！\nすみません、ちょっとお時間よろしいですか？", "zh": "啊，765制作人先生！\n不好意思，现在方便占用您一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1081_p", "source_sha256": "17c7161aadc6c9ec8a4d203961b7ae9a45bbdcf6f128e3f536ee5609b03683d5", "ja": "？　はい。", "zh": "？好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1083_029umi", "source_sha256": "e0ea6681962a0213b9f1efe7d75b26c9de0aacdc347c39176f02db53f223b567", "ja": "ええっ！？\nあの男の子、ケガしちゃったの！？", "zh": "诶！？\n那个男孩子受伤了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1084_p", "source_sha256": "179e16297bad1d9f2403d205a7ffb890e7d9de6e1678f2d9d956f9a674b0dc26", "ja": "そうみたいだ。足をくじいただけで、\n大ケガではないそうだけど……。", "zh": "好像是这样。他只是扭伤了脚，据说不是什么重伤……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1086_p", "source_sha256": "303ca9f794c69def6fe2987f59cc03b2384be330bdc28cac953a2aa53f98bbcd", "ja": "番組的には、本人が体操に乗り気じゃなかった事も\nあって、出演させない方向で考えているそうだけど……", "zh": "听说从节目方面来看，因为她本人也不太想参加体操，所以正在考虑不让她出演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1087_029umi", "source_sha256": "8866ee1e4d189f7f574187a55cffa7b82db6367f5614b6dd366bfb6726a07e2b", "ja": "……。広背筋、僧帽筋……ゆっくりほぐして、\n肩甲骨をまわして、側屈……。", "zh": "……。背阔肌、斜方肌……慢慢放松，\n转动肩胛骨，侧屈……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1088_p", "source_sha256": "df7e9cac0bef4a12f672d83a2e0768bf74df4791165aaaa97d35db6de878a61d", "ja": "……海美？", "zh": "……海美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1089_029umi", "source_sha256": "a34c9ce7f460a2a1f566af317e41b5a8839910cb00f6682dfe1cca2839001008", "ja": "あ、ごめん！　ちょっと、思い出してたの。\n上半身のストレッチ！", "zh": "啊，抱歉！我刚才在回想一些事情。\n上半身的拉伸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1090_029umi", "source_sha256": "f88b4c23da74771b88f382711a6c6314ad9da497e2b7941f6948900a115f808d", "ja": "バレエって、どうしても足を痛めやすいでしょ？\nそういう時でも、ストレッチは絶対してて……。", "zh": "芭蕾舞很容易伤到脚，对吧？\n即使是那种时候，也一定要做拉伸……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1091_029umi", "source_sha256": "ce0a948916b0f4d932135701415275ab07b40fce6cf1ec4987633b81a9c0e220", "ja": "あ、もちろん座ったままね！\n体を柔らかくするのって、健康にもいいから！", "zh": "啊，当然要坐着做！\n让身体变柔软，对健康也有好处！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1092_p", "source_sha256": "508a980718c23b443685847a96157ca1a0744bca82303daea2794f9ed18e9aee", "ja": "なるほど。\n座ったままできる体操か……。", "zh": "原来如此。\n坐着也能做的体操啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1093_029umi", "source_sha256": "4716aa20a005cf87b7c896888e0008d503cf2deb5d3f3544d24b6c3b3f6eb864", "ja": "うん。……あの子、体を動かすのは\n嫌いじゃないって言ってたんだ。", "zh": "嗯……她说过，她并不讨厌活动身体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1094_029umi", "source_sha256": "3836914c4bea5c54c85507f8c9c67e722022f542e287dda4cbb10dbe62514dc3", "ja": "上手にできなくて、笑われるのが嫌なんだって。\nだから……。", "zh": "她说，她讨厌自己做不好而被人嘲笑。\n所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1096_029umi", "source_sha256": "17c3f90fbb98d198ab52bf1d591bb6e6c8b19bfc8b46b6a413138fc59af5e126", "ja": "{$P$}。私、あの子にも出てほしい！\n『美ルドアップ体操』、楽しく踊ってもらいたい。", "zh": "{$P$}。我也希望那个孩子能参加！想让她开心地跳《美ルドアップ体操》。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1097_029umi", "source_sha256": "39533106c4b2d0520324af29ba8a02fb294baddf3dade65c7a24a772bb0f5342", "ja": "だって、そうじゃなかったら……。\n運動が、また嫌な思い出になっちゃうよ！", "zh": "因为不这样的话……\n运动就又会变成不愉快的回忆了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1098_p", "source_sha256": "32d3bd98ca50864b761ddaa710956e18f8f9e79c116a4842b7ba6533d6d97b1b", "ja": "そうか……。\n海美はそれがイヤなんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……\n海美是不喜欢那样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1099_029umi", "source_sha256": "456449dbe396243185182859e838baf2cfe596e61c43bc11d0369d70bad6b7ae", "ja": "うん！　だって、できないからって笑われるなんて……\nそんなの、誰だって運動が嫌いになっちゃうよね？", "zh": "嗯！因为仅仅是做不到就被嘲笑……\n那样的话，任谁都会讨厌运动的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1100_029umi", "source_sha256": "5ee1b6232fe02da16b3fa3c7a5cfaa57084f313b4c8cd2ded0f9c0a6c8ebc763", "ja": "だからそんな思い出、私が吹き飛ばしてあげたい！\n私があの子と一緒に歌って、踊って……。", "zh": "所以那样的回忆，就由我来帮你吹散吧！\n我会和那孩子一起唱歌、跳舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1101_029umi", "source_sha256": "abb968a194523e422b3b80ec6f03ff66073ae6fdb9ffd1321706969d9334290d", "ja": "それで、『ほら、できた！』って言うの！\nできるようになるって、すごいことだもん！", "zh": "然后要说：“看，做到了！”\n能够做到原本做不到的事，是很了不起的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1102_029umi", "source_sha256": "6e73ea4925583d7f14124cd1c0ce7a16e3d1d5486fb8a0c06296128acba4ba77", "ja": "わかったよ、{$P$}！\n私、いまわかった！", "zh": "我懂了，{$P$}！\n我现在想明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1103_p", "source_sha256": "01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69", "ja": "うん。", "zh": "嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1104_029umi", "source_sha256": "092b92db917f9c901e64ff410242107a915f62b1fa2cc4c1620a0f0c5d8ee467", "ja": "私、私ね！　体操とか運動とか、\n体を動かすことが誰かの中で……。", "zh": "我，我呢！体操啊、运动啊，\n这些活动身体的事，在某些人心里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1105_029umi", "source_sha256": "5e75ab86f9e54a2fccee82666673c96f666e9b2f5ca4628bfb08b82db1d84242", "ja": "できないとか、笑われたとか。\nそういう、嫌な思い出のまま終わってほしくないの！", "zh": "我不希望它因为做不到、被人嘲笑，就这样成为令人难过的回忆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1106_029umi", "source_sha256": "e027fffe360bf7c44e05c36c7b5efd7c83543185c2dd2106e48c1aa736b418e0", "ja": "だから……！", "zh": "所以……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1107_p", "source_sha256": "847a9c36b340f3ce8a3cad02f85c175060a047d9f12a203a170c0719b5879bfe", "ja": "うん。海美の気持ちはわかった。\nあの男の子の所に行って、話をしてみようか。", "zh": "嗯。我明白海美的心情了。\n去那个男孩子那里，找他聊聊看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1108_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "77c8ed583b0ee13686195af6ab822be6f555ef534a47a2a11d07e8e6532f4231", "ja": "すわって……。\nたいそうなのに、ですか？", "zh": "坐下……。\n明明是体操，您要坐下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1109_029umi", "source_sha256": "2f92c296ad3178e38603288ef6b7a2e6b60680a75a415962278a07e351e269a3", "ja": "そう！　腕だけ肩だけでできる運動は、\nいくらでもあるから。フリは私が考えるよ！", "zh": "没错！只用手臂或肩膀就能做的运动，多得是。所以动作就交给我来想！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1110_029umi", "source_sha256": "5b3a05fbcdbe33316201b394cbf923ee0faed09f46ea40c1e8bc1aa260b9a2db", "ja": "言ってたよね？\n体を動かすのは、嫌いじゃないって。", "zh": "你说过吧？\n不讨厌运动，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1111_029umi", "source_sha256": "fc640f2abd54c901721d545588d5e9cb5a6cb1f57a3171dc416e0dbed5ce1302", "ja": "だったら……『やりたい』って気持ちがあるなら、\nそれをあきらめるのは、悲しいでしょ？", "zh": "既然这样……如果有“想做”的心情，\n却要放弃它，不是很难过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1113_029umi", "source_sha256": "fd872fa6b87dd4acec4d44ba6ff8a44e59ff664c260dc31a59a96d8dfc76c99c", "ja": "ひとつだけできたらいいの！　そしたら、\nもうできないことじゃなくて、できることでしょ？", "zh": "只要能做到一件事就好！这样一来，它就不再是做不到的事，而是能做到的事了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1114_029umi", "source_sha256": "b807d3747c122d9831d3c5a34bc7bd8ddc876124ea19ccfc7a557df29c590298", "ja": "最初の一歩のお手伝いをするのが『美ルドアップ体操』\n……なんて、さっき決まったんだけどね。えへへ。", "zh": "帮你迈出第一步，就是『美ルドアップ体操』的意义所在……不过这是刚才才想到的啦。嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1115_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "473dd77568ab02452c933d159c52051ad54eec64208014ba1fa014d19653795f", "ja": "……。\nうまくいくかわからないですけど……。", "zh": "……。\n虽然不知道能不能顺利……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1116_029umi", "source_sha256": "3394e5ffa68ec45f0c6b90dc15a2f149bce4384825b6c0155ada945814d8ec5d", "ja": "全然大丈夫！\n私の手をとってくれれば、それだけで大丈夫！", "zh": "完全没问题！\n只要牵住我的手，这样就没问题了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1117_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "bd19161a245b5bf7b74279fae432dbbe527da7deb9d1e0ba7a0c71daa00ca4ed", "ja": "……うん。", "zh": "……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_157_1118_029umi", "source_sha256": "96d09de8b24eb66132c7476021d91fef925c347caabb150169c6a16281fba71b", "ja": "よーし！　それじゃあストレッチをしたら……\n本番、いっくよー☆", "zh": "好——！那做完拉伸后……\n正式演出，上咯——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
